{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1ccc18ddd8e68cae3e4fd2ee444bd05a08319444c6afe30d6dfb3c14dc1ab9ce","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24972c74497d107220541c6d830a90409ee3547ef511f70b45ec97b908c9febd","slc_667455eef92c030773356b0e1acde7b9bc2f5d245801d5d80155e4951a7db75a"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The kit exposes five stage-based commands: doctor (inspect without modifying), adopt (apply minimal harness pieces), review (challenge the diff pre-commit/PR), update (bring in a newer kit reference), and refresh (clean stale or duplicated guidance).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_23d93f19f5ecee94534d13459a6bf5290ff95d3e5741b6a78fb5d88242a367a5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13afa24f7f8b00e97489f9980d47f604569d2fdd35d643eacb07700834b386e3","slc_ae5d2d1c0705759a3e38d37f5a7874615c062c274df520b29fc9c4e5a3f83920"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"Besides prompt-first workflows, the same workflows are published as runtime-native skills for Codex and Claude Code, with the source package in agent-skills/ and packaging details in docs/agent-skills-package.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2a3fbe1163656d653457f9ec061f6c77f3c4581ffbf630e1e922f0de094f116f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_01797f006859fbd77c242d1886f54ae37bb7a53d054c7c1bc74f737f943e9ba7","slc_e732cb2d13164139032635b8c2db2c5a6526deca8921a6efe9d395c0865f2d06"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"Claude Code installation adds the harness-agent-skills-marketplace at v0.1.16 and installs harness-agent-skills@harnessworks, invoked via /harness-agent-skills:harness router commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38997cc2cbfdf3af116309a974924e2ed062adc0dd571e4d2788ef07a5326843","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9576d03f2194fc967c010f6732804d3fa80b7355dbf06c3d42f1b8934ebb9787"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The /harness command names are prompt conventions typed into the coding agent chat by default, not built-in editor commands; they appear in editor command palettes only if matching custom slash commands are added separately.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3ccc75abee1b4f0e36a22b25efafaa3b9dccb963b40f9ca03c317709a8e2e136","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e6e5547fbbf9cd7dcf09145f8294b34a49341221e23c9f13454c2d6e249df92e"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"Adoption is agent-driven rather than an automatic installer: the agent inspects the target repo first and applies only the smallest useful set of harness artifacts, following documented workflow and prompt files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5ed7bc6629a7e07827f2433dbf8087b5df48136011956343c8b0ce94dba3c559","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5d22e0546cd1d2e9f9e070106d2e46291c45ba74d4453fb1acb68771f7418ece"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The README states Harness Doctor can scan for durable repository evidence but cannot prove agents make fewer mistakes; harness health and agent effectiveness must be measured separately via task outcomes and effectiveness reports.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5f3de0cc38e94546acbfed22f1fb44951901ab905808f8c53a90d4d1dbd2a4d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fae2bea288e8e6263bfdb0b581c08c6d9b3ceb5d638b77c01142f8205d44647e"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The adoption prompt instructs the agent to treat the working directory as the target repo, treat the cloned kit as read-only reference, inspect before editing, preserve existing architecture and conventions, and add only minimal harness pieces.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_756a693a35619ad8f58aa2e7c0f823f7a0c150d473794119b3fc5ff0d37131e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a1abc219190050410b4e849df0b5fa80235cf0f32ab2cb14937909b3cfcecf04"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The kit ships evaluation materials (docs/evaluation.md, an effectiveness-report template, and a task-outcome.yaml template) for measuring comparable tasks, wrong-file edits, first-pass verification, and human rework.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_801686245ff566ef93f961a193ebc759f8c7e25be9e4a3a9417941926e7a01c6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44dbe1cce56c397db4a311053dd90f722f709cdaec04168bb24078d3fc71b470"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The expected adoption outcome includes a project-specific AGENTS.md, a knowledge store if none exists, lightweight drift checks from the repo's real rules, local verification commands, and an adoption report covering changes, checks, assumptions, failure memory, and gate placement.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5bf0d2bcb8d190c2c4d8b5ce42425431c315f7b3b338d59ef4f0e5b4f17164f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27e21154296f4f45e8303d10d71b1b917b0e18a78bd2c5755a03c84455812061"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"Harness Starter Kit is described as a prompt-first starter kit that converts repeated coding-agent mistakes into durable repository instructions, checks, memory, and evaluation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c4c409dcea5aa28520bf1df18e337500d0b2ddf7349cc920cbbdb7ea65dbd8b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8e6c9a72ba1c29ee8f71b234af41d4ac002fae1824362748daa87724d9a13e71","slc_e153af2229cc253f851dd98c21008a490304b8d54b8ca150175cc869183d7c8e"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"Codex installation uses the harnessworks/harness-agent-skills-marketplace plugin marketplace pinned at ref v0.1.16, followed by installing harness-agent-skills from the Harnessworks marketplace.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cd85e72fd579803ed8b1f0f2ac90932cb7b9f8edbe8cf3b886f3a7dfd6ac431e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fae2bea288e8e6263bfdb0b581c08c6d9b3ceb5d638b77c01142f8205d44647e"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The /harness review sub-agent request is treated as explicit permission to use a read-only reviewer subagent when the active runtime and tool instructions permit it; if unavailable, blocked, or failed, the fallback reason must be reported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fd507364b8f1e4ee88f7ed4f8140b78a5483457ef39af2ab55cb21ddaba326ec","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"harnessworks/harness-starter-kit@62437bec264b snapshot 08418ac572a3a2e1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43bdeba8f946ede9b8cef26b891cb2e59f6eb4f7d62ae0c57c949a7e966ab424"],"source_ids":["src_cae2eac77aff596698f4668cb7179d45"],"text":"The included dogfood reports (TodayBus for a Next.js target and Harness ERP for a Spring/Maven backend) are harnessed-only benchmarks and, per the README, do not prove effectiveness improvement.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ac9174b0714c40debc7e6c6c9fb40f92"}
